    "Scroll to Integrate calendar and copy the Secret address in iCal format." : {
      "comment" : "Settings > Connections: a step of the Google Calendar walkthrough. \"Integrate calendar\" and \"Secret address in iCal format\" are Google Calendar's labels; use its names in each language.",
