    "Tabbi reads a calendar from its private link. Copy your Google Calendar's link once and its events show up." : {
      "comment" : "Settings > Connections: the intro of the Add your Google Calendar walkthrough on Windows.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
