    "Windows doesn't let apps turn on Do not disturb. Turn it on yourself in Settings when you focus." : {
      "comment" : "Settings > Connections: the Do not disturb row's sentence. Use Windows' name for Do not disturb and for Settings.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يسمح Windows للتطبيقات بتشغيل عدم الإزعاج. شغّله بنفسك من الإعدادات عند التركيز."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows lässt Apps „Nicht stören“ nicht einschalten. Schalte es beim Fokussieren selbst in den Einstellungen ein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows no deja que las apps activen No molestar. Actívalo tú en Configuración cuando te concentres."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hindi pinapayagan ng Windows ang mga app na i-on ang Do not disturb. I-on mo ito sa Settings kapag nagfo-focus ka."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows ne laisse pas les apps activer Ne pas déranger. Active-le toi-même dans Paramètres quand tu te concentres."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windowsでは、アプリが応答不可をオンにできません。集中するときは設定から自分でオンにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows는 앱이 방해 금지를 켜도록 허용하지 않아요. 집중할 때 설정에서 직접 켜 주세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Windows não deixa apps ativarem o Não incomodar. Ative você mesmo nas Configurações quando for focar."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows не дает приложениям включать «Не беспокоить». Включай сам(а) в Параметрах, когда сосредотачиваешься."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 不允许应用打开请勿打扰。专注时请自己在设置中打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 不允許 App 開啟勿干擾。專注時請自己在設定中開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows may still be starting them. Check again in a moment." : {
      "comment" : "Settings > Connections: what to do when Windows' media controls didn't answer.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ربما لا يزال Windows يشغّلها. تحقّق مرة أخرى بعد قليل."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows startet sie vielleicht noch. Prüfe es gleich noch mal."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede que Windows aún los esté iniciando. Vuelve a comprobar en un momento."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baka sinisimulan pa ito ng Windows. I-check ulit mamaya."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows les démarre peut-être encore. Revérifie dans un instant."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windowsがまだ起動中かもしれません。少ししてからもう一度確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows가 아직 시작하는 중일 수 있어요. 잠시 후 다시 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Windows ainda pode estar iniciando. Verifique de novo daqui a pouco."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Возможно, Windows еще запускает его. Проверь чуть позже."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 可能还在启动它们。稍后再检查一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 可能還在啟動它們。稍後再檢查一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows uses %@ itself, so Tabbi can't take it. Record a different shortcut." : {
      "comment" : "Shown under the shortcut recorder when the combination is one Windows reserves (Win+L, Alt+Tab). %@ is the shortcut, such as Win+L.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يستخدم Windows الاختصار %@ بنفسه، لذا لا يمكن لـ Tabbi أخذه. سجّل اختصارًا مختلفًا."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows nutzt %@ selbst, Tabbi kann es also nicht übernehmen. Nimm einen anderen Kurzbefehl auf."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows usa %@ para sí mismo, así que Tabbi no puede usarlo. Graba un atajo distinto."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ginagamit ng Windows ang %@ mismo, kaya hindi ito makukuha ng Tabbi. Mag-record ng ibang shortcut."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows utilise %@ pour lui-même, Tabbi ne peut donc pas le prendre. Enregistre un autre raccourci."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@はWindows自身が使うので、Tabbiには使えません。別のショートカットを記録してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 키는 Windows가 직접 쓰고 있어서 Tabbi가 가져올 수 없어요. 다른 단축키를 기록해 주세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Windows usa %@ para si mesmo, então o Tabbi não pode usá-lo. Grave um atalho diferente."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows использует %@ сам, поэтому Tabbi не может его занять. Запишите другое сочетание."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 由 Windows 自己使用，Tabbi 无法占用。请录制其他快捷键。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 由 Windows 自己使用，Tabbi 無法佔用。請錄製其他快速鍵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your PC is charging, and %@ is having a sip" : {
      "comment" : "Closed island tooltip on Windows while the pet sips because the PC started charging; %@ is the pet's name.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
